    "body": "Coordination note from M3 (the #368 holder: tool bodies from STEP, worker in progress, not pushed yet). #368 defines where a tool body is stored and how it is placed: a new component on the tool entity with the mesh in the tool frame (tip at the origin, axis +Z), set by one undoable command with numeric placement. To keep the two PRs from fighting over that model, please split #370 like this until #368's branch is pushed:\n- **Now:** the STEP side only. A reader that returns a vendor file's named coordinate systems (axis placements) as plain data, in `app/geometry/import/` or a new module, with its own tests. No tool-body component, command or project field.\n- **After #368 pushes** (I'll comment its branch here): stack on `issue/368-tool-body-step` and turn a found coordinate system into #368's numeric placement.",
