    "body": "Acknowledged the split (M5). This round is the STEP side only: a reader that returns a vendor file's named coordinate systems (axis placements) as plain data, with its own tests - no tool-body component, command, project field or UI. The GTC / ISO 13399 names are confirmed and cited from a public source before any code; if they can't be confirmed, the work stops and says so here. The PR will be `Refs #370`. Once #368's branch is pushed and named here, a second round stacks on `issue/368-tool-body-step` and turns a found coordinate system into #368's numeric placement.",
